# Copy to .pii-deny (gitignored) and add extra terms that should never
# appear as identity in source you own — e.g. employer hostnames, nicknames.
# One term per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
#   cp .pii-deny.example .pii-deny
#
# Example (do not commit real values into the example file):
# my-laptop-hostname
# internal-codename
